      "cooked": "<p>Hi,</p>\n<p>When I am trying to create a quotation with zero Quantity with allow zero quantity checkbox checked in selling setting then system is allowing me to save quotation but system is not calculating a amount and we are not able to add amount.</p>\n<p>Let’s consider a use case like:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Item 1 with 100 rs rate and 5% GST</li>\n<li>Item 2 with 150 rs rate and 5% GST</li>\n<li>Item 3 is my misc. Income. It’s a service Item and 0 quantity with 250 rate and 18% GST.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>If I keep quantity as 1 of item 3 then system will increase total qty by 1 extra.</p>\n<p>Even I can’t add Misc Income in Taxes table. If I add a Item 3 in taxes table then I am not able to add tax rate by selecting tax type as Actual.</p>\n<p>If I add with GST amount directly by selection tax type as actual then my tax break up is showing a wrong as well.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/f/fffa82123bbfbc304579f2dfa754a061f6354144.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/fffa82123bbfbc304579f2dfa754a061f6354144\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/f/fffa82123bbfbc304579f2dfa754a061f6354144_2_690x304.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"AwusTAnXUdLHcUdVnSuHPPIImYA\" width=\"690\" height=\"304\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/f/fffa82123bbfbc304579f2dfa754a061f6354144_2_690x304.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/f/fffa82123bbfbc304579f2dfa754a061f6354144_2_1035x456.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/f/fffa82123bbfbc304579f2dfa754a061f6354144_2_1380x608.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1682×742 63.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/e/9e1f9c4dd0a44f4da9928837f6aea94d94ffc7dc.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9e1f9c4dd0a44f4da9928837f6aea94d94ffc7dc\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/e/9e1f9c4dd0a44f4da9928837f6aea94d94ffc7dc_2_690x196.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"myPagKFp09IIgmvMp9Y05ZmsDWk\" width=\"690\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/e/9e1f9c4dd0a44f4da9928837f6aea94d94ffc7dc_2_690x196.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/e/9e1f9c4dd0a44f4da9928837f6aea94d94ffc7dc_2_1035x294.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/e/9e1f9c4dd0a44f4da9928837f6aea94d94ffc7dc_2_1380x392.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1732×493 23.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>How this should be handled in other purchase and sales document as well like in sales Invoice.</p>",
